{
  "date": "2026-10-28",
  "category": "fintech",
  "title_zh": "丰隆银行客户可用银联二维码在海外付款",
  "title_en": "Hong Leong Bank customers can pay overseas with UnionPay QR codes",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "zh": "马来西亚的丰隆银行和银联国际合作，推出了跨境扫码服务。丰隆银行的客户用手机应用HLB Connect，就可以在世界各地接受银联二维码的商户付款。",
      "en": "Malaysia's Hong Leong Bank and UnionPay International have worked together to launch a cross-border QR-scan service. Using the HLB Connect mobile app, Hong Leong Bank customers can pay at merchants around the world that accept UnionPay QR codes."
    },
    {
      "zh": "客户可以扫商户的收款码，也可以打开应用里的付款码，让商户来扫。钱直接从个人银行账户扣除，不需要第三方支付应用，也不需要电子钱包。客户还可以提前换好人民币，先确定汇率。",
      "en": "Customers can scan a merchant's payment-collection code, or open the payment code in the app and let the merchant scan it. The money is taken directly from the personal bank account, with no need for a third-party payment app or an e-wallet. Customers can also exchange yuan in advance to fix the exchange rate first."
    },
    {
      "zh": "这个应用在中国也能扫描微信支付的二维码。两家公司从2018年开始合作，现在丰隆银行接受银联的商户已经超过4万家。今年上半年，马来西亚是中国入境游客的第三大来源地。",
      "en": "The app can also scan WeChat Pay QR codes in China. The two companies began cooperating in 2018, and more than 40,000 merchants now accept UnionPay through Hong Leong Bank. In the first half of this year, Malaysia was the third-largest source of visitors entering China."
    },
    {
      "zh": "在马来西亚，九成以上的商户可以接受银联卡。银联国际和当地的支付网络PayNet连接后，已有270多万家商户开通了银联二维码支付。",
      "en": "In Malaysia, more than 90% of merchants can accept UnionPay cards. Since UnionPay International connected with the local payment network PayNet, more than 2.7 million merchants have enabled UnionPay QR payments."
    }
  ],
  "source": {
    "name": "移动支付网",
